{"parse": {"title": "Prisoners of war in the Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present)", "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Russia and Ukraine exchanged 206 <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Prisoners_of_war\" title=\"Prisoners of war\">prisoners of war</a> through an agreement negotiated by the United Arab Emirates in September 2024.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-128\"><a href=\"#cite_note-128\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>127<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-129\"><a href=\"#cite_note-129\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>128<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Under another agreement facilitated by the United Arab Emirates, Russia and Ukraine exchanged 190 prisoners of war in November 2024.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-130\"><a href=\"#cite_note-130\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>129<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-131\"><a href=\"#cite_note-131\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>130<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In April 2026, Russia returned the bodies or remains of 1,000 soldiers to Ukraine, and Ukraine returned the bodies of 41 soldiers to Russia during a repatriation exchange.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-ki-20260409_133-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ki-20260409-133\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>132<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Since 2022 over 70 repatriations of human remains had taken place.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-bbc-20250611_134-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-bbc-20250611-134\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>133<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-icrc-20250617_135-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-icrc-20250617-135\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>134<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"cite_note-128\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-128\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4g5d7j9900o\" rel=\"nofollow\">\"Russia and Ukraine exchange 206 prisoners\"</a>. <i>BBC</i>. September 14, 2024.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=BBC&amp;rft.atitle=Russia+and+Ukraine+exchange+206+prisoners&amp;rft.date=2024-09-14&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.com%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fc4g5d7j9900o&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APrisoners+of+war+in+the+Russo-Ukrainian+war+%282022%E2%80%93present%29\"></span></span>\n</li><li id=\"cite_note-129\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-129\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/9/14/russia-and-ukraine-exchange-103-prisoners-each-in-deal-mediated-by-uae\" rel=\"nofollow\">\"Russia and Ukraine exchange 103 prisoners each in deal mediated by UAE\"</a>. <i>Aljazeera</i>. September 14, 2024.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Aljazeera&amp;rft.atitle=Russia+and+Ukraine+exchange+103+prisoners+each+in+deal+mediated+by+UAE&amp;rft.date=2024-09-14&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aljazeera.com%2Fnews%2F2024%2F9%2F14%2Frussia-and-ukraine-exchange-103-prisoners-each-in-deal-mediated-by-uae&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APrisoners+of+war+in+the+Russo-Ukrainian+war+%282022%E2%80%93present%29\"></span></span>\n</li><li id=\"cite_note-130\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-130\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2024/10/19/russia-and-ukraine-swap-prisoners-of-war-in-uae-mediated-exchange\" rel=\"nofollow\">\"Russia, Ukraine each bring home 95 prisoners of war in UAE-mediated swap\"</a>. <i>Al Jazeera</i>. October 19, 2024.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Al+Jazeera&amp;rft.atitle=Russia%2C+Ukraine+each+bring+home+95+prisoners+of+war+in+UAE-mediated+swap&amp;rft.date=2024-10-19&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aljazeera.com%2Fnews%2F2024%2F10%2F19%2Frussia-and-ukraine-swap-prisoners-of-war-in-uae-mediated-exchange&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APrisoners+of+war+in+the+Russo-Ukrainian+war+%282022%E2%80%93present%29\"></span></span>\n</li></ol><p>Unrelated paragraph about weather.</p></div>"}}